#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:1
msgid "Documentation decisions"
msgstr "Maamuzi ya nyaraka"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:3
msgid ""
"I wrote these pages as a sample of how I document an API for developers. "
"This page explains the choices, so you can judge my thinking as well as "
"my writing."
msgstr ""
"Niliandika kurasa hizi kama mfano wa jinsi ninavyoandika nyaraka za API "
"kwa ajili ya developers. Ukurasa huu unaeleza maamuzi niliyofanya, ili "
"uweze kutathmini namna ninavyofikiri pamoja na jinsi ninavyoandika."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:5
msgid "Why the quickstart comes first"
msgstr "Kwa nini quickstart inakuja kwanza"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:7
msgid ""
"Someone evaluating an API wants proof that it works before they read "
"anything else. The quickstart gets a real request running in a few "
"minutes, then explains every field in the response. Every other page "
"links back to it."
msgstr ""
"Mtu anayekagua API anataka uthibitisho kwamba inafanya kazi kabla ya kusoma "
"kitu kingine. Quickstart inawezesha request halisi kuanza kufanya kazi ndani "
"ya dakika chache, kisha inaeleza kila field katika response. Kila ukurasa "
"mwingine unaunganisha tena na ukurasa huo."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:9
msgid "Why the examples are real files"
msgstr "Kwa nini mifano ni faili halisi"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:11
msgid ""
"The code on these pages is pulled straight from the `examples` folder. I "
"ran each one against the running service: curl, Python and JavaScript. "
"The docs show exactly the code that ran, and there is no second copy to "
"go stale. Sample code that drifts away from the docs is one of the most "
"common ways developer documentation stops being trusted."
msgstr ""
"Code iliyo kwenye kurasa hizi inatoka moja kwa moja kwenye folda ya "
"`examples`. Niliendesha kila mfano dhidi ya service inayofanya kazi: curl, "
"Python na JavaScript. Nyaraka zinaonyesha code ileile iliyotekelezwa, na "
"hakuna nakala ya pili inayoweza kupitwa na wakati. Sample code inayotofautiana "
"na nyaraka ni mojawapo ya sababu zinazofanya nyaraka za developers zipoteze "
"uaminifu."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:13
msgid "Why errors get their own page"
msgstr "Kwa nini errors zina ukurasa wake"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:15
msgid ""
"Errors are where developers spend most of their debugging time. Every "
"failure uses one shape, with a `type` to branch on, a `message` for "
"people and a `request_id` for support. The table says which errors are "
"worth retrying, because that is the question a developer actually has at "
"that moment."
msgstr ""
"Errors ndizo sehemu ambayo developers hutumia muda wao mwingi wa debugging. "
"Kila failure hutumia muundo mmoja, wenye `type` ya kuamua hatua inayofuata, "
"`message` kwa ajili ya watu na `request_id` kwa ajili ya support. Jedwali "
"linaonyesha ni errors zipi zinafaa kujaribiwa tena, kwa sababu hilo ndilo "
"swali ambalo developer huwa nalo wakati huo."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:17
msgid "Why the reference is generated"
msgstr "Kwa nini reference inazalishwa"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:19
msgid ""
"The API reference comes from `openapi/openapi.yaml`, and that file is "
"exported from the service code. The continuous integration check fails if"
" the file is out of date. I would rather explain the API in prose and let"
" a tool list the parameters, because copying parameters by hand is how "
"references end up wrong."
msgstr ""
"API reference inatoka kwenye `openapi/openapi.yaml`, na faili hiyo "
"hutolewa kutoka kwenye code ya service. Ukaguzi wa continuous integration "
"hushindwa ikiwa faili hiyo haijasasishwa. Ningependelea kueleza API kwa "
"maandishi na kuacha tool iorodheshe parameters, kwa sababu kunakili "
"parameters kwa mkono ndiko kunakosababisha references kuwa na makosa."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:21
msgid "Why the model is a stub"
msgstr "Kwa nini model ni stub"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:23
msgid ""
"I do not have a real model, and inventing behaviour I cannot verify would"
" make these docs untrustworthy. The stub returns predictable text, so "
"every response on these pages is exactly what you get if you run the "
"request. The tokenizer is simple for the same reason, and the tokens page"
" says so plainly."
msgstr ""
"Sina model halisi, na kubuni tabia ambayo siwezi kuithibitisha kungefanya "
"nyaraka hizi zisiwe za kuaminika. Stub inarudisha text inayotabirika, hivyo "
"kila response kwenye kurasa hizi ni sawa kabisa na utakayopata ukiendesha "
"request. Tokenizer ni rahisi kwa sababu hiyo hiyo, na ukurasa wa tokens "
"unasema hivyo wazi."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:25
msgid "Why tokens and regions get attention"
msgstr "Kwa nini tokens na regions zimepewa kipaumbele"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:27
msgid ""
"For developers building in African languages, two questions come up "
"early: how many tokens their text will use, and where their data is "
"processed. I added a token counting endpoint and a `region` parameter to "
"give those questions a place in the documentation. They are illustrative "
"design choices for this sample, not claims about any real service."
msgstr ""
"Kwa developers wanaojenga mifumo kwa lugha za Kiafrika, maswali mawili "
"huibuka mapema: maandishi yao yatatumia tokens ngapi, na data yao "
"itachakatwa wapi. Niliongeza endpoint ya kuhesabu tokens na parameter ya "
"`region` ili kutoa nafasi ya maswali hayo ndani ya nyaraka. Haya ni maamuzi "
"ya mfano ya muundo wa mfumo huu, si madai kuhusu service yoyote halisi."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:29
msgid "What I left out on purpose"
msgstr "Nilichoacha kwa makusudi"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:31
msgid ""
"I left out streaming, official SDK packages, billing and pagination. A "
"small set of pages done properly is more useful than a large set done "
"quickly. Streaming would be my next addition, because it changes what a "
"quickstart looks like."
msgstr ""
"Niliondoa streaming, official SDK packages, billing na pagination. Seti "
"ndogo ya kurasa zilizofanywa vizuri ni muhimu zaidi kuliko seti kubwa "
"iliyofanywa kwa haraka. Streaming ingekuwa nyongeza yangu inayofuata, kwa "
"sababu inabadilisha jinsi quickstart inavyoonekana."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:33
msgid "What I would do with a real product"
msgstr "Ningefanya nini na bidhaa halisi"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:35
msgid ""
"I would sit with the engineers and read the code before writing a word. I"
" would run every example myself, and I would use support tickets and "
"usage data to decide what to document first. I would also keep a "
"changelog, so developers can see what changed between versions."
msgstr ""
"Ningekaa na engineers na kusoma code kabla ya kuandika hata neno moja. "
"Ningeendesha kila mfano mwenyewe, na ningetumia support tickets pamoja na "
"data ya matumizi kuamua nini cha kuandika kwanza. Pia ningedumisha "
"changelog, ili developers waweze kuona kilichobadilika kati ya versions."